QUERY PLAN                                                
----------------------------------------------------------
Update on bt                                              
  ->  Nested Loop                                         
        ->  HashAggregate                                 
              Group Key: bs.bid                           
              ->  Nested Loop                             
                    ->  Index Scan using bs_flag on bs    
                          Index Cond: (flag = 'x'::text)  
                    ->  Index Scan using bc_pkey on bc    
                          Index Cond: (id = bs.cid)       
                          Filter: (region = 'south'::text)
        ->  Index Scan using bt_pkey on bt                
              Index Cond: (id = bs.bid)                   
(12 rows)

step s3pr: EXPLAIN (COSTS OFF) UPDATE bt SET st = 'self', v = bt.v + 2 WHERE bt.id IN (SELECT b2.id FROM bt b2 JOIN bc ON bc.id = b2.id WHERE b2.id % 100 = 0 AND bc.region = 'south');
